<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  pcdswidgets EthercatTerminalStateDoubleRow (ECS Common Ethercat), size class "double row":
  800 x 100 minimum, stretches horizontally to fill its container, height fixed at 100.
    title: PyDMLabel_name (TERMINAL_NAME) | type (TERMINAL_TYPE) | PV base
    row 1: State (PyDMLabel_rbv = State_RBV) | Flags (StateRaw bits) | Request (PyDMEnumComboBox_state = State_SP)
    row 2: Link (LinkCode decoded: condition . port)                 | Access (EDITABLE / LOCKED)
  Macros -> designer properties: PREFIX (prefix, IOC prefix incl. trailing colon), PORT (port),
  TERMINAL_NAME (terminal_name), TERMINAL_TYPE (terminal_type).
  Logic (Flags/Link decoding, access gating, request confirmation) lives in
  pcdswidgets/common/ethercat/ethercat_terminal_state_double_row.py.
  No inline styleSheet: the look comes from the application theme; status colours come
  from ethercat_status.qss (ecatStatus rules). No macros on the root widget (builder rule).
-->
